# B&B optimization example for cardinality-bounds.
# The disjoint union of K22,22 and C5 has 49 vertices and independence number
# 24. Two registers cover at most 48 vertices, so the catalogue bound proves
# infeasibility with spills forbidden.
# Run from the repository root.
# Enabled:  ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -fcardinality-bounds examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-cardinality-bounds.pbqp
# Baseline: ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -fno-cardinality-bounds examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-cardinality-bounds.pbqp
# Observed with Clang 21 Release on Intel Core Ultra X7 358H.
# Median elapsed CLI time over five alternating runs, including startup.
# Enabled: 7.9 ms, 5/5 infeasible.
# Baseline: 707.8 ms, 5/5 timeout.

